**/.DS_Store
target
.idea
.stamps
.claude/worktrees
.claire
**/*.aux
**/*.log
**/*.pdf
# Binder covers are committed artifacts, not build output: the make rule that
# draws them has no prerequisites, so a fresh clone must carry the reviewed
# cover rather than redraw one. `make -C unitXX clean_unit_cover` redraws.
!**/binder_cover/main.pdf
**/*.fls
**/*.fdb_latexmk
**/__pycache__
.agents
